       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"958306\" data-output-id=\"12\" data-out-n=\"90\" data-sub-idx=\"8\" data-output-format=\"Auto\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"4\" data-sub-start=\"10\" data-sub-end=\"14\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[90]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"/Users/aaron/PHY304-Labs/img/Lab6/wl_138ahlyxypu2f.svg\" width=\"480\" height=\"285\" src=\"img/Lab6/wl_138ahlyxypu2f.svg\" data-wl-plot=\"/Users/aaron/PHY304-Labs/img/Lab6/wl2d_kq6wt2kcde8l.json\" data-wl-plot-src=\"img/Lab6/wl2d_kq6wt2kcde8l.json\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\nClear[x, sol];\nm = 10;\nk = 20;\nb = 1;\nF0 = 10;\nx0 = 0;\nv0 = 0;\n\nsol = NDSolve[{x''[t] + (b/m) x'[t] + (k/m) x[t] == (F0/m) Cos[(0.5 + 0.01*t) * t], x[0] == x0, x'[0] == v0}, x, {t, 0, 100}]\n\nPlot[Evaluate[x[t] /. sol], {t, 0, 100},\n    PlotLabel -> \"Driven Damped Oscillator with Varying Frequency\",\n    AxesLabel -> {\"Time (s)\", \"Position (m)\"},\n    PlotRange -> All\n]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
